  "term": "DIC",
  "definition": "DIC refers to digital infrastructure construction, meaning the development of interconnected and intelligent urban infrastructure based on technologies such as advanced communications, artificial intelligence, and cloud computing. In this context, it is described as a basis for smart urban transformation and for strengthening a city’s ability to respond to and recover from risks.",
